        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 4815-EXT, Apollo Exterior Handleset Trim</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis is exterior replacement handleset trim only for the Apollo Entry Handleset.  It does not include the interior lever or knob trim.   It is available in a single cylinder function and a dummy function. Single cylinder trim includes lock cylinder with 2 keys.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Emtek Apollo Exterior Handleset Trim:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Top Plate Height: 10-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Top Plate Width: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Bottom Plate Height: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Bottom Plate Width: 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Projection: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Grip Clearance: 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Grip Thickness: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Distance between Deadbolt and Lever Latch: 5-1/2\" c.c.</li>\r\n<li>Distance between Latch Bore to Bottom Mounting Hole: 8-5/8\" c.c.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-4805-specifications.pdf?v=1704262352\"><b>Emtek 4815 Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-Handle-B-Specifications.pdf?v=1704262345\"><b>Emtek Tubular Entryset Template Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Full Dummy Set:</b> Trim for non-working doors. It does not latch and does not lock. Usually used as matching trim for the non-working side of double doors.</li>\r\n<li><b>Single Cylinder:</b> From the exterior, a thumb piece operates the handleset latch and a key operates the deadbolt. </li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-modern-levers-Finishes.jpg?v=1704354533\" width=\"599\" height=\"111\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Emtek Finish Chart\">\r\n</p>",
